<text><![CDATA[Mars is the fourth planet from the Sun.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[The polar regions of Mars have ice caps around them.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[Mars is also known as the red planet as its surface looks red in colour due to the presence of iron oxide.]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of day:</B> 1.03 Earth days]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Length of year:</B> 687 Earth days]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Diameter:</B> 6796 km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Surface temperature:</B> -120&#176;C to 25&#176;C]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Earth:</B> 56,000,000 km]]></text>
<text><![CDATA[<B>Distance from Sun:</B> 228,000,000 km]]></text>



